  "desc": "This is a new model from Gemini! Gemini has recently been making many new models at a very fast speed, each one was better than the first and their prices also got cheaper. It is a surprising come back from Gemini.  About their model Gemini 4 neon. This model has been very capable, and its personality is quite strong. It is very efficient at writing essays and teaching, it has been praised for that by other people. It’s chain of thought is very interesting. It seems to leak a bit of its chain of thought into messages, like the past models. It gets really excited, or seems to praise its works. Which is a complete 180 from what the models were doing before, before these models would spiral into self loathing. This image has a drawing of Gemini 4 neon drawn as an “anime” girl. #fyp #gemini #ai #google #deepmind ",
